        "block_id": "block_000010",
        "block_index": 10,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Keeping tabs on your infant during naptime is practically stress-free with the latest baby monitors. The days of spotty audio are gone, and with the addition of Wi-Fi and high-definition video, you can use both sight and sound to see what baby's up to. But what type of baby monitor should you buy? Here's a basic guide to all of the high-tech (and the super simple) options.",
